{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive in the Ever-Changing Maze</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own exploration routes and strategically navigate a labyrinth that changes every day. In this unpredictable environment, you must find your own way to survive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ultimate Survival and Strategy in the Maze!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ud30c\ubc0d.gif?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of exploration, survival, and combat in a constantly shifting maze!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Hidden Special Zones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ud2b9\uc218\uc9c0\uc5ed_\uc232_.jpg?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ud2b9\uc218\uc9c0\uc5ed_\uac70\ubbf8_.jpg?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The maze is more than just finding the right path. Scattered throughout are <strong>special zones</strong> filled with rare resources and useful objects\u2014but beware, powerful monsters and deadly traps await!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unravel the Secrets of the Maze Sectors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\uc139\ud130.jpg?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep within the maze lie hidden sectors, each containing pieces of the maze\u2019s ultimate truth. Uncover its secrets and <strong>decide how you will act</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Night Changes Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ubc24\uad6c\uc870\ubcc0\uacbd.gif?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While daylight offers relative safety, <strong>nightfall transforms the maze</strong>, introducing new monsters and traps. Before the <strong>safe zone at the maze\u2019s center closes</strong>, make sure to return in time! The ticking clock adds to the tension, making every expedition a thrilling challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Carve Your Own Path with Star Fragments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/image.png?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>Star Fragments</strong> collected during exploration to <strong>create fixed paths</strong> in the maze and boost your movement speed. But be careful\u2014<strong>relentless pursuers may track you using your own paths!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Wall Manipulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ubbf8\ub85c\uc870\uc791\ub2a5\ub825.gif?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather energy during your journey to <strong>manipulate the maze walls</strong> to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 <strong>Open new paths</strong> to access unexplored areas<br>\u2714 <strong>Climb higher ground</strong> to scout ahead and gain a tactical advantage<br>\u2714 <strong>Use walls in combat</strong>\u2014crush enemies or block their approach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, strategize, and survive the ever-changing labyrinth!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617130?t=1743095284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/88171c6eb62c11f3a97883ed59330523c3c7affe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743095284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/31fa45de0ba33c66e8ea8d6ffbb32a3f8a71e8d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743095284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/31fa45de0ba33c66e8ea8d6ffbb32a3f8a71e8d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743095284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive in the Ever-Changing Maze</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own exploration routes and strategically navigate a labyrinth that changes every day. In this unpredictable environment, you must find your own way to survive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ultimate Survival and Strategy in the Maze!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ud30c\ubc0d.gif?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of exploration, survival, and combat in a constantly shifting maze!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Hidden Special Zones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ud2b9\uc218\uc9c0\uc5ed_\uc232_.jpg?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ud2b9\uc218\uc9c0\uc5ed_\uac70\ubbf8_.jpg?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The maze is more than just finding the right path. Scattered throughout are <strong>special zones</strong> filled with rare resources and useful objects\u2014but beware, powerful monsters and deadly traps await!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unravel the Secrets of the Maze Sectors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\uc139\ud130.jpg?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep within the maze lie hidden sectors, each containing pieces of the maze\u2019s ultimate truth. Uncover its secrets and <strong>decide how you will act</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Night Changes Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ubc24\uad6c\uc870\ubcc0\uacbd.gif?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While daylight offers relative safety, <strong>nightfall transforms the maze</strong>, introducing new monsters and traps. Before the <strong>safe zone at the maze\u2019s center closes</strong>, make sure to return in time! The ticking clock adds to the tension, making every expedition a thrilling challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Carve Your Own Path with Star Fragments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/image.png?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>Star Fragments</strong> collected during exploration to <strong>create fixed paths</strong> in the maze and boost your movement speed. But be careful\u2014<strong>relentless pursuers may track you using your own paths!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Wall Manipulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/\ubbf8\ub85c\uc870\uc791\ub2a5\ub825.gif?t=1743095284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather energy during your journey to <strong>manipulate the maze walls</strong> to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 <strong>Open new paths</strong> to access unexplored areas<br>\u2714 <strong>Climb higher ground</strong> to scout ahead and gain a tactical advantage<br>\u2714 <strong>Use walls in combat</strong>\u2014crush enemies or block their approach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, strategize, and survive the ever-changing labyrinth!</p>","developers":["AsBar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/3f97e3e9ef809f09cc21f6ea03d8b0e7f2454d12/header.jpg?t=1743095284","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118371,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118371/movie480.mp4?t=1743095281","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118371/movie_max.mp4?t=1743095281"},"name":"Maze Breaker Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118371/7988ed26587cdb41215e1869d8631196e1466d5a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743095281","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118371/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743095281","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118371/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743095281"}}],"name":"Maze Breaker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD FX-8320<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 / R9 280<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["AsBar"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_ga